        "original_id": "ff2f990d-ce41-5893-b748-3093a0fb2ba0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: César Cui\n- Works: Prisoner of the Caucasus (opera)\n- Topics: opera, music criticism\n\nFacts:\n- César Antonovich Cui was born on 18 January 1835 (O.S. 6 January) and died on 13 March 1918.\n- César Cui was a Russian composer and music critic of French, Polish, and Lithuanian descent.\n- Prisoner of the Caucasus, also known as \"Кавказский пленник\" and transliterated as \"Kavkazskij plennik,\" is an opera in three acts.\n- César Cui composed the opera Prisoner of the Caucasus.",
